alue":"Simply this: quantity doesnâ€™t equal quality. Itâ€™s not that most strategies are ineffective. But the vast majority wonâ€™t be right for your business. Even worse, wading through mountains of information to find best-fit strategies is time-consuming and more frustrating than a bad toothache.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This guide takes a different approach. It provides a solid overview of whatâ€™s working in B2B SaaS lead-gen in 2025. However, the focus is on pinpointing those two or three approaches with a good chance of working for your business.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"With a tailored mix, you can target the right prospects, differentiate your brand, and reach those all-important decision-makers.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Sound good? Letâ€™s crack on and generate some B2B leads.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"What Is SaaS B2B Lead Generation?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"B2B SaaS lead generation is the process of engaging and nurturing potential customers for B2B SaaS products.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Itâ€™s one of the most important aspects of running a SaaS company, with a direct impact on baseline metrics like revenue and profitability. Without a smoothly running B2B lead-gen engine at the start of the buyer journey, the business will eventually fail.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Effective lead gen is the top priority for ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.ruleranalytics.com/blog/inbound-marketing/lead-generation-statistics/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"91% of B2B marketers","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":". In addition, marketers list improving lead conversion rates and generating more leads as their ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://vib.tech/resources/marketing-blogs/b2b-marketing-trends/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"top challenges","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":".Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Most lead gen for B2B SaaS is digital and falls into three categories: paid, unpaid, and organic. Paid B2B lead generation relies on ad platforms like Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, X Ads, and so on. Unpaid strategies include cold outreach, referrals, and re-engagement campaigns. Organic traffic lead gen uses high-value content to engage potential customers through social, search, and email.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"53FJhUxJWe3xhBeq4Fua3l","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-08-10T00:55:33.141Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-10T00:55:33.141Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":16,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Paid vs Organic","description":"Three squares against a green background, each containing an emoji. From left to right: a dollar sign with the words \"Paid, PPC, Influencer partnerships, sponsored content\", another dollar sign with the words \"Unpaid, cold outreach, re-engagement (past clients), referrals, joint ventures\", and a plant growing out of dirt with the words \"Organic, social media posts, search engine traffic, online communities.\"","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/53FJhUxJWe3xhBeq4Fua3l/d59d9ed458886c6cb60604785a2805ed/Paid_vs_Organic.webp","details":{"size":180984,"image":{"width":2989,"height":1279}},"fileName":"Paid vs Organic.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"SaaS lead generation has three important characteristics that separate it from its B2C counterpart:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Multiple stakeholders are usually involved in the buying process.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The market tends to be narrower because the targets are businesses, not consumers.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The marketing and sales cycle is longer than for B2C, sometimes spanning months.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"B2B SaaS is a highly competitive space. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://explodingtopics.com/blog/number-of-saas-companies"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hundreds of startups","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" are launched every year, with multiple providers vying for the same paying customers.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This competition highlights the importance of brand differentiation, constant innovation, and exceptional customer service. With an iron-clad value proposition in place, achieving a high B2B lead conversion rate becomes significantly easier.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"15 Strategies for B2B SaaS Lead GenerationÂ ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Letâ€™s look at the top strategies in 2025 for boosting your marketing efforts and connecting with high-value, eager-to-buy leads.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"1. Create Valuable ContentÂ ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Most content online isâ€”how can we say this nicelyâ€”useless fluff. Yet the SaaS providers winning at the content game, producing material thatâ€™s ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"actually useful","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":", are generating consistent and high-quality leads practically on autopilot.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"For example, companies with regularly updated blogs generate ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.hubspot.com/marketing-statistics"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"67% more leads per month on average","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" compared to those without blogs.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Here are some steps for guaranteeing the quality of your content:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Focus on thought leadership with input from subject-matter experts where appropriate.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value